{"id":"steam-1195080","steam":1195080,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"佣兵地下城/Hell Warriors","summary":"一个魔幻的世界，玩家扮演城堡领主，组建自己的佣兵部队。各种各样的系统、新奇的佣兵、多样的战斗，只有合理搭配，才能在战斗中战胜对手","about":"☆☆创新碰撞式战斗，佣兵勇闯地下城☆☆\r\n勇闯地下城，迷宫夺宝！有史以来最轻松最有乐趣的冒险推图玩法！！\r\n\r\n【游戏简介】\r\n创新碰撞式战斗玩法，地下城冒险RPG手游。玩家在游戏中组建自己的佣兵团队，在地宫中进行探险寻宝，享受超凡游戏体验。游戏画面采用经典的色块风格，地下城玩法表现的方式带给玩家精致细腻的游戏感受。《佣兵地下城 Hell Warriors》主要围绕佣兵队伍的组建、佣兵的升级、强化、突破，挑战不同难度的地下冒险地宫展开一系列的策冒险略玩法，根据佣兵的自身特点和组合作用，选择最佳战斗策略，体验西方魔幻时代的特性佣兵，成为最佳的佣兵领主。\r\n\r\n【游戏特色】\r\n1、全球竞技 排行PK挑战巅峰\r\n2、无尽模式 挑战你的持久力\r\n3、迷宫冒险 巧算步数智夺宝\r\n4、百种佣兵 多角色组队搭配\r\n5、精准操控 策略烧脑挑战boss\r\n\r\n【联系小窝】\r\n如您在游戏中遇到任何问题，或者要向我们提供宝贵建议。请直接联系我们的客服同学！\r\n官方QQ群：246522724","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1195080/library_600x900.jpg?t=1575420966","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1195080/header.jpg?t=1575420966","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1195080/library_hero.jpg?t=1575420966","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1195080/header.jpg?t=1575420966","background":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1195080/page_bg_generated_v6b.jpg?t=1575420966","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1195080/ss_450c94484f25140775454fc2d88d3d43f8464fc1.600x338.jpg?t=1575420966","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1195080/ss_450c94484f25140775454fc2d88d3d43f8464fc1.jpg?t=1575420966"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1195080/ss_3a260128c4d31d396ac184521e840df3d61dcd5a.600x338.jpg?t=1575420966","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1195080/ss_3a260128c4d31d396ac184521e840df3d61dcd5a.jpg?t=1575420966"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1195080/ss_e4aea34de0aef6ab8b9620c1d06f498f5cd45aab.600x338.jpg?